The Claude Code CLI (``claude``) is an OPTIONAL external subprocess invoked by
a deployment's author-dispatch wiring (``ne.skills_cc.subprocess_dispatch``).
It is NOT a bundled or declared Python dependency of this package — it is
located on ``PATH`` and executed as a subprocess at the deployment's
discretion, the same way a deployment might invoke any external CLI tool.
